            "text": "# Datalake-server — `blitz-datalake-server`. Elixir/Phoenix GraphQL\n# serving app (see elixir_common.tf for shared scaffolding + the\n# BEAM-clustering caveat). Ported from production's\n# app_datalake.tf. Sibling of the already-ported data-api (apps_data.tf)\n# — same `datalake` Sentry project, so the DSN reuses\n# `apps_secrets.data_api`. Airflow (also in prod's app_datalake.tf) is\n# deliberately NOT ported: its admin UI relies on IAP for auth\n# (X-Goog-Authenticated-User-Email header, auto-admin) — on VA1 that\n# would become an unauthenticated admin panel — and it orchestrates\n# GCP Dataproc anyway, so it stays in GCP.\n"
